{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55650","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十八 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高才宏略气凌云，世上浮名梦里身。\n苏氏谩称降六国，韩公休说卷三秦。\n当朝虽立千年事，古庙唯存一聚尘。\n毕竟思量浑大错，何如林下养天真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}